      "content": "that makes sense. but honestly, it feels like a lot of their arguments are just NIMBY-ism, right? like the \"neighborhood character\" thing is just a way to keep people out and keep property values high. do you think it's worth even giving them much space in the briefing, or should i just focus on the benefits to keep the meeting productive?",
